      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-05-01T00:09:31.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Finished this Ra costume a few weeks ago. (Not a lot of options for a guy with no hair.&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"> ) I'll definitely be wearing it to Origins and GenCon.</p>\n<p>Haven't really had time to post picture anywhere, so I guess this is as good of time as any. One of these is the unaltered image and the other was 'shopped by a friend.</p>\n<p>Pydro: I'd say yes.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/sunglasses.png?v=9\" title=\":sunglasses:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sunglasses:\">  I've spent the past year working on my Ra costume, but my next one will definitely be my card.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/15eea8de258111692e49fc95d9cb0e233e157fcf.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/15eea8de258111692e49fc95d9cb0e233e157fcf\" title=\"russ-ra_fixed_small.jpg\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/15eea8de258111692e49fc95d9cb0e233e157fcf_2_375x500.jpeg\" alt=\"russ-ra_fixed_small.jpg\" data-base62-sha1=\"381lS9WeVYgLLzAJ4cZycNat0Or\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/15eea8de258111692e49fc95d9cb0e233e157fcf_2_375x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/15eea8de258111692e49fc95d9cb0e233e157fcf_2_562x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/15eea8de258111692e49fc95d9cb0e233e157fcf_2_750x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/15eea8de258111692e49fc95d9cb0e233e157fcf_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">russ-ra_fixed_small.jpg</span><span class=\"informations\">1296×1728 385 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/8/8cdd14d388f53f39832003c527e38c62c7eaf3c0.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/8cdd14d388f53f39832003c527e38c62c7eaf3c0\" title=\"russ-ra_small.JPG\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/8cdd14d388f53f39832003c527e38c62c7eaf3c0_2_374x500.jpeg\" alt=\"russ-ra_small.JPG\" data-base62-sha1=\"k68vEgSzlFCJd3mwqJLL6kd5YaY\" width=\"374\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/8cdd14d388f53f39832003c527e38c62c7eaf3c0_2_374x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/8cdd14d388f53f39832003c527e38c62c7eaf3c0_2_561x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/8cdd14d388f53f39832003c527e38c62c7eaf3c0_2_748x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/8cdd14d388f53f39832003c527e38c62c7eaf3c0_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">russ-ra_small.JPG</span><span class=\"informations\">1118×1491 434 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
